      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/Granby,_Massachusetts",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "In the 1950s and 1960s, new single‑family homes in Colonial Revival style appeared, blending with historic structures while keeping farmland intact.",
